    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hotlines won't change the fact that the walls are closing in. i'm not looking for a lecture on safety, i'm looking for some kind of dignity in this. if everything is going to be lost anyway, shouldn't there be a way to face it with some grace, instead of just being torn apart when the silence finally breaks?",
